  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "afbf6340-16fe-44ae-9962-35122a99bd6f"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives the differential of the Sullivan model ",
 StyleBox["model", "TI"],
